# SBA - Subtract B from A (opcode 0x10)

---
name: subtracts B from A
memory: 10
setup: a=10 b=01
expect: a=0F N=0 Z=0 V=0 C=0
cycles: 1

---
name: sets zero
memory: 10
setup: a=10 b=10
expect: a=00 Z=1 N=0 C=0
cycles: 1

---
name: sets negative and carry
memory: 10
setup: a=10 b=20
expect: a=F0 N=1 C=1
cycles: 1
